    "name": "Selected Translated Abstracts of Russian-Language Climate-Change PublicationsOther",
    "description": [
      "The Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center, in collaboration with the All-Russian Research Institute of Hydrometeorological Information-World Data Center (RIHMI-WDC) (Obninsk, Russia), published the four-volume Selected Translated Abstracts of Russian-Language Climate-Change Publications. The series, produced under the auspices of a 1972 US-USSR agreement on protection of the environment, opens up to western researchers a wealth of climate-change literature that has previously been available only in Russian. The English-language abstracts are available online from the four reports."
    ],
